  "description": "Eun-gil Gong’s used to seeing her name in the news. As volleyball’s problem child, she’s seen it all, but the world discussing her upcoming marriage to Hahyeon Seo, eldest son of JaeKyung and owner of her former team, is another matter... Especially since Hahyeon only offered the contract marriage to clean up the rumors about Mina—his sister and Eun-gil’s only fan—being gay. Between the money and helping Mina, it was easy to accept, but one question remains: What’s he getting out of this? \n\n(Source: Tapas)",
